```text
1. Create clank-server entrypoint and gpu_box service module
    [x] 'content/clank-server.py': New standalone server entrypoint
        - imports existing services directly (IngestionServiceImpl, KBServiceImpl, PromptServiceImpl, LinuxDiskAdapter, RuamelYamlParserAdapter)
        - no AppEngine, no FrontendService, no queue/ReplySlot machinery
        - boot sequence in entrypoint: instantiate adapters → run ingestion → handle_start → store state → start HTTP server
        - local endpoints: /api/boot, /api/char, static file serving via SimpleHTTPRequestHandler pointing at content/web-ui/frontend/
        - GPU box endpoints (/v1/chat/completions, /api/desktop-mode, /api/inference-mode) dispatch to services.gpu_box
        - single-threaded, synchronous handler — request in, service call, result out
    [x] 'content/services/__init__.py': Package init, exposes gpu_box service
    [x] 'content/services/gpu_box.py': GPU box forwarding service
        - encapsulates the urllib.request forwarding logic (request body, headers, Authorization passthrough)
        - accepts target path + incoming request data, hits the configured GPU box URL, returns status/headers/body
        - handler writes bytes back; service does not do HTTP serving, only the outbound call
        - raises or returns structured error on upstream failure (502)
```
